      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the keys and they seem fine. i'm also seeing some weirdness where it works one time and then fails two times in a row with the same payload. could there be some kind of race condition or something in the way the backend is handling the session? how can i trace if it's a state issue vs just a bad payload?",
